1
00:00:00,193 --> 00:00:01,903
(Howard:)Hang on,
the sensor's picking up something.

2
00:00:02,069 --> 00:00:03,779
(Howard:)Turn your head back.

3
00:00:09,577 --> 00:00:11,867
(Penny:)You rat bastard.

4
00:00:13,456 --> 00:00:15,586
HOWARD:
Told you the sensor would work.

5
00:00:16,751 --> 00:00:17,921
(Scene:)Hi.

6
00:00:18,085 --> 00:00:20,125
(Penny:)You deliberately stuck me with Sheldon.

7
00:00:20,296 --> 00:00:22,636
Come on, I had to.
You see what he's like.

8
00:00:22,798 --> 00:00:25,468
SHELDON:
Penny? Penny, I'm hungry.

9
00:00:26,177 --> 00:00:27,807
(Penny:)It's okay, sweetie. Good news.

10
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,720
(Penny:)- Leonard's home.
- No.

11
00:00:29,889 --> 00:00:32,479
- Here you go, good luck, bye.
- Oh, wait, wait.

12
00:00:32,642 --> 00:00:37,392
SHELDON: Leonard? I'm hungry.
- Wait. Penny, take me with you.

13
00:00:41,734 --> 00:00:43,484
SHELDON:
Leonard?

14
00:00:46,989 --> 00:00:48,869
(Sheldon:)I want grilled cheese.

15
00:01:07,343 --> 00:01:11,183
(Sheldon:)Do you think Penny will come here
and take care of us?

16
00:01:12,098 --> 00:01:15,518
(Leonard:)I don't think Penny's
ever coming here again.

17
00:01:18,145 --> 00:01:21,025
(Sheldon:)I'm very congested.

18
00:01:22,275 --> 00:01:23,855
Yeah? So?

19
00:01:24,026 --> 00:01:28,826
(Sheldon:)Can you go to the kitchen and get me
the turkey baster labeled, "Mucus"?

20
00:01:31,826 --> 00:01:34,956
(Leonard:)If I stand, I'll vomit.

21
00:01:35,496 --> 00:01:38,496
(Sheldon:)Under the sink. Yellow Tupperware bowl.

